    turnFlow: 'Must follow suit. In trump contracts, must trump if unable to follow (even underruff). In negative contracts, no trumps; if unable to follow, discard a penalty card if you have one. In Rıfkı and Kupa (Hearts), hearts may not be led unless already broken or you have only hearts. Penalty cards must be played when a higher card of the suit has been played to the trick.',
