      play_card: 'Must follow suit if possible. In trump contracts must trump if unable to follow. In negative contracts if unable to follow discard a penalty card if you have one. In Rıfkı and Kupa hearts may not be led unless broken or only hearts in hand. Must play penalty card when a higher card of the suit has been played to the trick.',
